{"material_id":"mat_661e7cf8f34e","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"cmssir12d047oroffnpn5pcx1","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"公众号：智谱（GLM）","author_followers":null,"title":"GLM-5.3 发布：编程能力开源第一，并涌现网络安全能力","excerpt":"智谱发布GLM-5.3，基于与GLM-5.2相同的基座，通过极致的后训练Scaling提升智能上界，编程能力较前代提升50%，在Terminal Bench 3.0等公开基准中取得开源第一，并接近Claude Fable 5。模型在白盒代码审查等安全任务中表现持平Mythos 5，在CyberGym测试中得分84.5%。模型权重将在两周后开源，即日起上线ZCode、AutoClaw等工具。","source_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyMzI3NzQ0Mg%3D%3D&mid=2247494084&idx=1&sn=a2e5cd9a534a4825feb3633ea1b6d492","canonical_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkyMzI3NzQ0Mg%3D%3D&idx=1&mid=2247494084&sn=a2e5cd9a534a4825feb3633ea1b6d492","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-08-14T05:31:04.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-08-15T02:15:00.298Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"accepted","rejection_reasons":[],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"公众号：智谱（GLM）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["actionable_update","ai_basics","ai_coding","ai_news"],"relevance_score":57,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":71,"fingerprint":"661e7cf8f34e0c7fc280af81d4af5d68ee9aaffecbb839cd5976de709f0a72c0","content_fingerprint":"05028f775f6e67235e1df3cd442c6ec8bcc5faec4b7823073b7510f7a7df5b50"}
